sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Web
  participant Gateway
  participant Auth
  participant Order
  participant Inventory
  participant Redis
  participant DB
  participant EventBus
  participant Payment
  User->>Web: 提交订单
  Web->>Gateway: POST /orders
  Gateway->>Auth: 校验 token
  Auth-->>Gateway: 用户身份
  Gateway->>Order: createOrder
  Order->>Redis: 查询幂等键
  alt 命中
    Redis-->>Order: 已有订单
  else 未命中
    Order->>Inventory: reserve
    Inventory->>DB: lock stock
    DB-->>Inventory: locked
    Inventory-->>Order: reserved
    Order->>Payment: charge
    alt 支付成功
      Payment-->>Order: paid
      Order->>DB: persist paid order
      Order-)EventBus: publish OrderPaid
      Order->>Redis: 写入幂等结果
    else 支付失败
      Payment-->>Order: declined
      Order->>Inventory: release
      Inventory->>DB: unlock stock
      Order-)EventBus: publish PaymentFailed
    end
  end
  Order-->>Gateway: order result
  Gateway-->>Web: HTTP result
  Web-->>User: 展示结果
